<mjml>
  <mj-body background-color="#f4f4f4">
    <mj-include path="../partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="30px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <!-- Title -->
        <mj-text
          font-size="22px"
          font-weight="bold"
          color="#b71c1c"
          align="center"
        >
          Admission Offer Withdrawal Notice
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Greeting -->
        <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#555555" padding-top="10px">
          Dear {{ applicantName }},
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Introduction -->
        <mj-text font-size="15px" color="#555555" line-height="24px">
          Thank you for your interest in Northbridge Collegiate and for taking
          the time to apply for admission.
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Main Message -->
        <mj-text font-size="15px" color="#555555" line-height="24px">
          After careful review of your application, we regret to inform you that
          Northbridge Collegiate has decided to
          <strong>withdraw your offer of admission</strong>.
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Highlight Box -->
        <mj-text
          background-color="#fff4f4"
          padding="18px"
          font-size="15px"
          color="#333333"
        >
          <strong>Reason:</strong><br />
          Outstanding required documentation and/or failure to satisfy one or
          more of the conditions of admission within the prescribed timelines.
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Additional Information -->
        <mj-text font-size="15px" color="#555555" line-height="24px">
          As the required admission conditions were not fulfilled within the
          specified timeframe, your admission offer can no longer be maintained.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="15px" color="#555555" line-height="24px">
          Should you meet the admission requirements in the future, you are
          welcome to submit a new application for consideration. We would be
          pleased to review your application at that time.
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Note -->
        <mj-text
          font-size="13px"
          color="#999999"
          background-color="#fafafa"
          padding="15px"
          line-height="20px"
        >
          If you believe this decision has been made in error or you have
          questions regarding your application, please contact the Admissions
          Office for further assistance.
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Closing -->
        <mj-text
          font-size="15px"
          color="#555555"
          padding-top="20px"
          line-height="20px"
        >
          We sincerely appreciate your interest in Northbridge Collegiate and
          wish you every success in your future academic pursuits.
          <br /><br />
          Warm regards,<br /><br />
          <strong>Admissions Office</strong><br />
          Northbridge Collegiate
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="../partials/footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>